  "body": "Various instances of Z_alpha are used throughout the codebase (in maurer.py, mostCommonValue.py, noniid_collision.py, SP90Bv2_predictors.py), and in each case this value is approximated as 2.576. Baring some specific reason to round, it seems reasonable to use this value in as precise a way as double-based arithmetic allows, which would be 2.5758293035489008.",
